<p><h2>**Help Sarge!!!**</h2>
<p>
<i>I'm running out of cool catch phrases...</i>
<p>
--Me

<p>The title pretty much says it all.  Save Sarge!  Only this time its a little different:  Sarge hooked his rain temple up to the main core of nimbus, to give him more power so he can use all of the elements.  He forgot to take on thing into consideration:  The core is very,very explosive.  So basically what i'm saying is, if Sarges temple gets destroyed, bye bye you guys!  Uh, good luck, this time i'm serious, YOU'LL NEED IT!

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=5>
$Button=EQUIPEMENT,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Blow these wind guys(away),DoNothing,0

